WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.835
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers,
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:04.236
We hope you're doing
well tonight.

00:00:04.236 --> 00:00:05.905
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:09.743
The White House today announced
plans to form a task force

00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:11.377
to combat online harassment.

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:13.379
Go to their website to check out
the announcement,

00:00:13.379 --> 00:00:14.380
but heads up --

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:17.417
do NOT read the comments.

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:19.085
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:21.687
Dr. Anthony Fauci
tested positive yesterday

00:00:21.687 --> 00:00:23.623
for a breakthrough case
of the coronavirus.

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:26.459
Wow! Fauci is like
COVID's final boss.

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.127
This is...

00:00:28.127 --> 00:00:31.631
This is like hearing that the
Coyote caught the Roadrunner.

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:32.865
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.865 --> 00:00:34.467
Also, you caught it now?

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:36.802
You made it through
all that time

00:00:36.802 --> 00:00:39.872
in the maskless
Trump White House,

00:00:39.872 --> 00:00:41.374
and you caught it now?

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:43.876
That's like running a triathlon
with no problems

00:00:43.876 --> 00:00:46.913
and then throwing your back out
petting a dog.

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:48.415
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.415 --> 00:00:50.416
Florida yesterday
became the only state

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:53.252
to skip pre-ordering doses
of the coronavirus vaccine

00:00:53.252 --> 00:00:54.587
for young children.

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:57.824
To be fair, Florida
doesn't have children.

00:00:57.824 --> 00:00:59.325
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:00.827
Authorities in New York
this week

00:01:00.827 --> 00:01:04.063
seized more than a dozen
Weed World Candies trucks

00:01:04.063 --> 00:01:07.066
because some owed
more than half a million dollars

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:08.067
in parking tickets,

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:09.735
Said the drivers,

00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:11.237
"Parking?"

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:12.772
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:18.578
"We thought we were speeding."

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:20.546
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.546 --> 00:01:22.848
Organizers of a British
music festival announced

00:01:22.848 --> 00:01:25.718
that rapper Lil Wayne
will no longer perform

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:27.887
after he was denied entry
into the UK

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.856
because on his health form
screening,

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:32.525
he put down
that he was wheezy.

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:34.294
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:40.199
I mean, it's not great,
but it tracks.

00:01:40.199 --> 00:01:41.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:43.969
And finally, producers
of the upcoming Barbie movie

00:01:43.969 --> 00:01:46.906
released a picture yesterday
of actor Ryan Gosling as Ken

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:49.642
with bleached blond hair
and six-pack abs.

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:51.644
And in an homage
to the original toy,

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:53.780
his head was facing
the wrong way.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:54.781
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:56.950
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

